        "l": 90.5697,
        "t": 583.3208000000001,
        "r": 545.7937000000002,
        "b": 557.9438
      },
      "content": "If the compressor is installed outdoors or if the air inlet temperature can be below 0 °C , precautions must be taken. In this case, and also if operating above 1000 m , consult Atlas Copco.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1163",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_7",
      "section_level": 2,
