    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0808",
      "reading_order": 1168,
      "section": "Moving/lifting",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 160.53,
        "t": 412.4249983,
        "r": 548.9548574900012,
        "b": 367.1278792
      },
      "content": "In case of units equipped with the Lifting Device Option, it is not allowed to lift the compressor if the canopy parts or lifting supports are not completely installed. When the compressor is  being lifted, it is also forbidden to come under the load or to perform maintenance activities to it.",
